    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Build the Reveal",
    "long_instructions": "# Build the Reveal\r\n\r\n**Goal:** When a user clicks the button, show more information for that specific item without reloading the page.\r\n\r\n1. **Choose Your Reveal Method:** Pick one approach:\r\n   * **Toggle Method:** Show and hide a hidden section inside the card, OR\r\n   * **Fetch Method:** Request extra detail data for that item and display it inside the card.\r\n2. **Create a Detail Area:** Add a placeholder area in your card where the extra info will appear (even if it starts empty or hidden).\r\n3. **Update Only One Card:** When the button is clicked, reveal or fill in the detail area for the selected card only.\r\n4. **Test the Result:** Click different cards and confirm each one reveals the correct details.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Write the code that reveals extra information for the selected card, either by toggling hidden content or by fetching detail data and injecting it into the card.",
